Project: LeanSift
URL: https://github.com/rhiestan/LeanSIFT
License: BSD-2-Clause
Upstream commit: 9c621f8f7075dbb3d164c620fa90cf02a26a449d

Only the library is vendored (CMakeLists.txt, cmake/, include/, src/); the
tests, tools and their support code are not. Google Highway, its only
dependency, is fetched by CMake (FetchContent); set
FETCHCONTENT_SOURCE_DIR_HWY to a local Highway 1.4.0 checkout to build offline.

Used by nonFree/sift/SIFT_describer.hpp (the "SIFT" image describer) in place
of VLFeat's SIFT.
